        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 71000ACB, Solid Brass Patio Door Trim Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic styling of Omnia's 71000 series multipoint trim grants it an elegance that is only enhanced through the addition of one of the beautiful lever design options--all of which are just as sophisticated as the patio trim itself. These solid brass leversets are for use with American Cylinder Below Lever (american profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors. Available in 4 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Thru-Bolts</b> are fixed at 8-1/2\" center to center and can not be modified. In some cases new thru-bolting holes must be drilled in your door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced. The multipoint trim set is intended to replace the original trim from G-U, Marvin Integrity, KML by Anderson, Atrium, Superior, and others. The <b>Lock to Lever</b> distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-CONTEMPO-SN-SM.jpg?v=1704354674\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"71000ACB Multipoint Trim Sets dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Arched Patio Door Trim <a href=\"/products/arched-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-71000aca\">with <b>American Cylinder Above</b> the lever</a> and <a href=\"/products/arched-european-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-71000ecb\">with <b>European Cylinder</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Omnia 71000ACB Multipoint Trim Sets\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass Trim</li>\r\n<li>Lock to Lever Spacing: 3-5/8\" (92 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Thru-Bolt Hole Spacing: 8-1/2\"  (216 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 9-5/8\" (244 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-3/4\" (44 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 1/2\" (12.5 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arched American Cylinder Patio Door Trim Set",
                "description": "Omnia 71000ACB American Cylinder Below - The classic styling of Omnia's 71000 series multipoint trim grants it an elegance that is only enhanced through the addition of one of the beautiful lever design options--all of which are just as sophisticated as the patio trim itself. These solid brass leversets are for use with American Cylinder Below Lever (american profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors. Available in 4 finishes.",
